===========================================================================

IRIX still uses SGI's GL libraries.  To switch this machine's n32 OpenGL
and IRIS GL to the IRIS host-GL shims, as root:

	${PREFIX}/share/iris-tools/install-iris-gl.sh

and to switch back (do this before removing the package):

	${PREFIX}/share/iris-tools/install-iris-gl.sh -u
===========================================================================
